# Keep build context small and secret-free.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.git
**/.github
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.md
!README.md
docs/

# The backups folder (ADR-0192): database copies that hold password hashes. Never an image layer, and
# on the CI runner it belongs to uid 1000, which the build client could not read anyway.
/backups
